## To release a new version, edit the version in the two lines below and nothing else.
## |cRRGGBB...|r in Title and Author colours them in the in-game add-on list; the version
## is read back through that markup, so it can sit inside or outside the colour.
## The settings panel takes its version from ## Title; the name itself is fixed in Main.lua.
## Title: |cFF69B4PB's Omikuji|r 1.1.0
## Author: |cFF69B4PinkBanther|r
## Description: Draws a Japanese fortune slip in chat when you log in. One of 365 written fortunes, one for every day of a year -- seven ranks from Daikichi (great blessing) down to Daikyou (great curse) -- picked from the date and the character, so the same character sees the same fortune all day and each of your characters gets its own. Content is Japanese. /omikuji shows today's again.
## Version: 1.1.0
## APIVersion: 101050 101051
## OptionalDependsOn: LibHarvensAddonSettings>=20106
## SavedVariables: PBsOmikuji_Data

lang/strings.lua
lang/$(language).lua

Main.lua
Fortunes.lua
Draw.lua
Settings.lua

